  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">The spherical book is hinged with book cloth and opens to reveal six nested "pages" of text that unstack to be read. Necessary disclosures is cast with a blend of flax, cotton and abaca fibers. The text is letterpress printed and the book is housed in a clear plexiglass box.</subfield>
  </datafield>
  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Text by Pei Minxin and Sara Kasper: "Lessons from the past: the American record in nation-building"; American Lands Alliance; Greg Myre: "Victorious Sharon refuses Arafat's offer of peace talks"--Accompanying sheet.</subfield>
  </datafield>
